PP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Objectif de ta semaine ? La récup, la récup et la récup ! Interdit d'accélérer aujourd'hui c'est endurance fondamentale stricte... et même si ça te semble rabat-joie, c'est pour ton bien, tu nous remercieras quand tu seras au top de ta forme à la fin du plan ! :)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1788739200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.017543859649122,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40_6LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Encore un footing accompagné de lignes droites ! J'espère que tu ressens l'effet positif que ces lignes droites ont sur ta mécanique ? Personnellement, je me sens vraiment \"bien dans ma foulée\" après avoir fait des lignes droites ! C'est comme si ça remettait tout en place !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":192,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_4","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":4,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1788739200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.8859235872344176,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1800,"pace":{"value":327}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z2","duration":240,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartPPGSessionWithStats","name":"PERF - MID - FORCE + AS  - SEMAINE 4 SEANCE 2","description":"Séance en 2 blocs. Le premier est composé de 5 séries de 3 exercices enchainés sans pause. Le second est composé de 3 séries de 2 exercices enchainés sans pause. Prend 1'30  de récupération entre les séries des bloc 1, et 1' entre les séries du bloc 2. ","displayName":"Renforcement","coachAdvice":"La bonne maîtrise des exercices est essentielle pour que la pratique du renforcement ne soit pas délétère sur le long terme. L'intensité d'un exercice doit toujours être limitée par sa réalisation technique.","importance":true,"trainingType":"PPG","trainingCategory":"gpp","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":5,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Split Squat avec charge additionnelle","exerciseType":"ppg","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"maximal","repeat":4,"durations":[],"gearVariation":{"difficultyAdjustedWithWeights":false,"difficultyVariations":[{"name":"Fente arrière","description":"","variationType":"simplified","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730151937-dsc3692.png","muxPlaybackId":"hb4BQg4cqbEo2jFyobgiiaVMM9Lvq227","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730151937-dsc3692.png","muxPlaybackId":"K3t4gDQOM02dAnQYrsSalA01mNjkty8xiu","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Split Squat","description":"","variationType":"standard","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393345-dsc4097.png","muxPlaybackId":"Xh02xvMtrbJimagSnxQkz00TA2t